<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Ometraco Corp nine-mth net up.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Ometraco Corp nine-mth net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>			 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>Financial services</p>
<p>    Income				    306.31 vs 117.61</p>
<p>    Expenses				  246.86 vs  97.25</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			   58.47 vs  22.57</p>
<p>Non-financial services</p>
<p>    Revenue				   877.91 vs 706.48</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			   47.20 vs  54.08</p>
<p>Consolidated results</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  105.67 vs  76.66</p>
<p>    Profit before minority interest    79.75 vs  57.57</p>
<p>    Net profit				 52.95 vs  36.75</p>
<p>Note: The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Ometraco Corporation is the holding company of the Ometraco Group.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
